            %p
              for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-colimit"} (∞,1)-colimit
              functor.
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              We may think of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Γ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma
              equivalently as
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  forming flat
