              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-module+bundle"} (∞,1)-module bundle
              which is constant on the chain complex concentrated on
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi k
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
              in degree 0, the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+unit"} tensor unit
              in
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
